baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">: Messe de requiem</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(39, 39, 39); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">NB</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(39, 39, 39); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;: L’inhumation se fera dans la plus stricte intimité familiale</span></p><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-905a12a9-7fff-f768-aa22-e5d05a3a6cf3\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p>', '2024-05-21 16:05:25', NULL, '_article_664cd0d17baa8.jpg', 'article-obseques-de-lex-president-de-la-republique-henri-konan-bedie-voici-le-programme-052421', 'Obsèques de l’ex président de la République Henri Konan Bédié : Voici le programme', NULL, 1, 25, 1, 6, 1, 1, 75);
