(781, 'Le permis de conduire à points : Voici la liste des infractions qui font perdre des points', 'article-le-permis-de-conduire-a-points-voici-la-liste-des-infractions-qui-font-perdre-des-points-012324', 'Le principe du permis à points consiste à allouer un capital de 12 points à chaque permis de conduire. Ce capital de points fait l\'objet de diminution en cas d\'infraction commise par le titulaire dudit permis de conduire.', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\r\ncolor:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;\">Le retrait des points est fonction de la nature des infractions commises. Les opérations de retrait de points se font pour les infractions constatées par vidéo- verbalisation ou par les agents verbalisateurs munis de terminaux reliés à la base de données du Ministère des Transports.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\r\ncolor:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\r\ncolor:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\r\ncolor:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\r\ncolor:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><u><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14pt;\">LES DIFFERENTS TYPES D\'INFRACTIONS</span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><u><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></u></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\r\ncolor:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\r\ncolor:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;\">Le ministère des transports a établi une liste non exhaustive, ni limitative des infractions les plus récurrentes et responsables de nombreux accidents routiers. La liste ci-dessous est une première ébauche qui servira de guide aux officiers verbalisateurs.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\r\ncolor:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\r\ncolor:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\r\ncolor:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\r\ncolor:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><u><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14pt;\">LES INFRACTIONS ENTRAINANT UNE PERTE DE 2 POINTS</span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\r\ncolor:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\r\ncolor:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;\">Circulation sur la partie gauche de la chaussée en marche normale</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\r\ncolor:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom