(826, 'Le communiqué intégral du conseil des ministres du mercredi 5 avril 2023', 'article-le-communique-integral-du-conseil-des-ministres-du-mercredi-5-avril-2023-042306', 'Un conseil des ministres s\'est tenu ce mercredi 5 Avril 2023. Ci-dessous l\'intégralité du communiqué', '<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n  <div align=\"center\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 37.5pt 0cm 15pt;\">\r\n    <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n     <tbody><tr>\r\n      <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:100.0%;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n      <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n       <tbody><tr>\r\n        <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0cm 11.25pt 0cm 11.25pt\">\r\n        <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n         <tbody><tr>\r\n          <td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n          <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n           <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:3.75pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;\r\n            margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;\r\n            mso-outline-level:2\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">MESURES\r\n            GENERALES&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n           </tr>\r\n          </tbody></table>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n      </tbody></table>\r\n      </td>\r\n     </tr>\r\n    </tbody></table>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n  <div align=\"center\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 0cm 0cm 15pt;\">\r\n    <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n     <tbody><tr>\r\n      <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:100.0%;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n      <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n       <tbody><tr>\r\n        <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0cm 11.25pt 0cm 11.25pt\">\r\n        <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n         <tbody><tr>\r\n          <td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n          <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n           <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:11.25pt 0cm 0cm 3.75pt\">\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            line-height:normal;mso-outline-level:3\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">PROJETS DE DECRETS&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n           </tr>\r\n          </tbody></table>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n      </tbody></table>\r\n      </td>\r\n     </tr>\r\n    </tbody></table>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n  <div align=\"center\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 0cm;\">\r\n    <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n     <tbody><tr>\r\n      <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:100.0%;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n      <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n       <tbody><tr>\r\n        <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n        <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n         <tbody><tr>\r\n          <td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n          <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n           <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0cm 15.0pt 0cm 15.0pt\">\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">1- Au titre du Ministère d’Etat, Ministère de l’Agriculture et\r\n            du Développement Rural, en liaison avec le Ministère du Budget et\r\n            du Portefeuille de l’Etat ;</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n           </tr>\r\n          </tbody></table>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n         <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n          <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n           <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:7.5pt 15.0pt 7.5pt 15.0pt\">\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Le Conseil a adopté un décret déterminant les procédures\r\n            d’immatriculation des terres du domaine foncier rural.</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\"><br>\r\n            &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Pris en\r\n            application de la loi n° 98-750 du 23 décembre 1998 relative au\r\n            domaine foncier rural, ce décret vise à accélérer les opérations de\r\n            délimitation des biens fonciers ruraux ainsi que la création des\r\n            titres de propriété sur les terres du domaine foncier rural.<br>\r\n            Il organise, à cet effet, une procédure d’immatriculation\r\n            simplifiée, mieux adaptée aux réalités du milieu rural et propice à\r\n            une délivrance massive des titres de propriété...<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n           </tr>\r\n          </tbody></table>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n      </tbody></table>\r\n      </td>\r\n     </tr>\r\n    </tbody></table>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n  <div align=\"center\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 0cm;\">\r\n    <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n     <tbody><tr>\r\n      <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:100.0%;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n      <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n       <tbody><tr>\r\n        <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n        <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n         <tbody><tr>\r\n          <td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n          <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n           <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0cm 15.0pt 0cm 15.0pt\">\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">2- Au titre du Ministère de la Justice et des Droits de l’Homme\r\n            ;</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n           </tr>\r\n          </tbody></table>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n         <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n          <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n           <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:7.5pt 15.0pt 7.5pt 15.0pt\">\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Le Conseil a adopté un décret portant réglementation des\r\n            Etablissements pénitentiaires et fixant les modalités d’exécution\r\n            de la détention des personnes.</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Ce décret\r\n            procède à une profonde restructuration du dispositif pénitentiaire\r\n            national en lien avec les standards internationaux. La gouvernance\r\n            des établissements pénitentiaires, le régime disciplinaire du\r\n            personnel pénitentiaire ainsi que le régime disciplinaire des\r\n            détenus et les modalités de leur détention ont été intégralement\r\n            remaniés, de façon à garantir de meilleures conditions de détention\r\n            et à assurer une meilleure insertion sociale à ces personnes, au\r\n            terme de l’exécution de leur peine privative de liberté.<br>\r\n            Il introduit notamment une nouvelle structuration du dispositif\r\n            pénitentiaire avec la création de trois (03) catégories\r\n            d’établissements pénitentiaires,...<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n           </tr>\r\n          </tbody></table>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n      </tbody></table>\r\n      </td>\r\n     </tr>\r\n    </tbody></table>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n  <div align=\"center\">\r\n  <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n   <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 0cm;\">\r\n    <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n     <tbody><tr>\r\n      <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:100.0%;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n      <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n       <tbody><tr>\r\n        <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n        <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n         <tbody><tr>\r\n          <td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n          <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n           <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0cm 15.0pt 0cm 15.0pt\">\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">3- Au titre du Ministère des Eaux et Forêts, en liaison avec le\r\n            Ministère de l’Economie et des Finances, le Ministère de la\r\n            Construction, du Logement et de l’Urbanisme et le Ministère du\r\n            Budget et du Portefeuille de l’Etat ;</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n           </tr>\r\n          </tbody></table>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n         <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n          <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n           <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:7.5pt 15.0pt 7.5pt 15.0pt\">\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Le Conseil a adopté un décret portant redéfinition des limites\r\n            de la forêt classée de l’Anguédédou, ainsi qu’une communication y\r\n            afférente.</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\"><br>\r\n            &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Cette\r\n            mesure s’inscrit dans le cadre de la mise en œuvre d’un programme\r\n            renforcé de protection de la forêt classée de l’Anguédédou qui,\r\n            avec la forêt du Banco, joue un rôle majeur dans la qualité de\r\n            l’environnement urbain du District d’Abidjan, en termes de\r\n            purification de la ville et de ses environs des polluants\r\n            atmosphériques liés notamment aux activités industrielles.<br>\r\n            Ce programme prévoit au-delà de la délimitation de cette aire\r\n            protégée, la construction d’une clôture ceinturant toute la forêt\r\n            classée et la démultiplication de patrouilles...<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n            text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n           </tr>\r\n          </tbody></table>\r\n          </td>\r\n         </tr>\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n        </td>\r\n       </tr>\r\n      </tbody></table>\r\n      </td>\r\n     </tr>\r\n    </tbody></table>\r\n    </td>\r\n   </tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r